//! DAW operating modes
//!
//! This module provides the mode views for different workflows:
//!
//! - `Compose` - Arrangement and composition
//! - `Record` - Audio/MIDI recording
//! - `Mix` - Mixing console
//! - `Master` - Mastering and loudness
//! - `Practice` - Learning and practice tools (TODO)
//! - `Release` - Export and rendering (TODO)
//! - `Distribute` - Publishing and distribution (TODO)

